      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im a type 1 and im feeling kinda weird right now. like i'm super shaky and sweating a lot and i feel a bit lightheaded. my blood sugar was a little high like 180 an hour ago but im feeling bad now so should i just take an extra unit of my rapid insulin to level it out so i dont spike more?",
